    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meteors are falling from the sky. Hurry up, your objective is to eliminate them by aligning same-colored blocks and launching them upward. Meteorder is an exciting tile-matching puzzle game where you can compete against opponents, explore various planets, and enjoy the beats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3118050/extras/ee05e357cedd7813379ea55cff202339.poster.avif?t=1743534585\" width=600 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3118050/extras/ee05e357cedd7813379ea55cff202339.webm?t=1743534585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3118050/extras/ee05e357cedd7813379ea55cff202339.mp4?t=1743534585\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your cursor to move the blocks vertically (up or down).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Match three identical blocks horizontally or vertically to ignite them and launch them upwards. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Continue igniting the blocks mid-air until they reach the top of the screen and disappear.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3118050/extras/ba651819c35e46928828192bb909b0fe.avif?t=1743534585\" width=600 height=229 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Modes</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free Mode: Play against various AI opponents or relax and play solo.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge Mode: Aim for the highest score within a limited time, or compete against a super AI.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Championship: Continuously challenge opponents and win the final championship.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Galaxy Voyage: Embark on an interstellar travel adventure, choose different routes, and follow unique game rules.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore New Planets</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The meteorites you launch will become your resources. Collect them to discover new planets (Themes), each with unique styles and game characteristics, offering completely different experiences and strategies.</p>",
